# {{name}}

A Rusta API project scaffolded with `cargo rusta new`.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Run locally
cargo run

# Or with Docker
docker compose up --build
```

The API will be available at `http://localhost:3000`.

## Project Structure

```
{{name}}/
├── src/
│   ├── main.rs           # Application entry point
│   ├── lib.rs            # Library exports
│   ├── config.rs         # AppConfig from environment
│   ├── controllers/      # HTTP handlers
│   └── services/         # Business logic
├── tests/integration/    # Integration tests with testcontainers
├── Dockerfile
├── docker-compose.yml
└── .env.example
```

## Endpoints

| Method | Path     | Description    |
| ------ | -------- | -------------- |
| GET    | `/health` | Health check   |

## Environment Variables

| Variable      | Description       | Default          |
| ------------- | ----------------- | ---------------- |
| `SERVER_PORT` | Server bind address | `0.0.0.0:3000` |

## Running Tests

```bash
# Build the test image first
docker build -t {{name}}:test -f {{name}}/Dockerfile .

# Run all tests
cargo test
```
